[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-nnpc-agip-postgraduate-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-190":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},190,"nnpc-agip-postgraduate-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-190","Nnpc Agip Postgraduate Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The NNPC Agip Scholarship 2026 is a joint initiative by NNPC and Nigerian Agip Exploration Limited for Nigerian students to pursue postgraduate studies in Nigeria and overseas.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>NNPC Agip Postgraduate Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: NNPC &amp; Agip\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-asia\u002F\">Study-In-Asia\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-africa\u002F\">Study-In-Africa\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-canada\u002F\">Study-In-Canada\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-australia\u002F\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-usa\u002F\">Study-In-USA\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: May 7, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>NNPC Agip Postgraduate Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Nigerian Agip Exploration (NAE) Limited, on behalf of the NNPC\u002FNAE PSC, is committed to the training and development of manpower as part of its Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>In pursuance of this, NAE invites applications from suitably qualified and interested Nigerian graduates for the \u003Cstrong>2026\u002F2027 NNPC Agip Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fstrong> The award is in two categories: – \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>1. Overseas – For study in a reputable overseas university\u003Cbr \u002F>2. Local – For study in a recognized Nigerian university\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>NNPC Agip Scholarship 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The NNPC Agip Postgraduate Scholarship offers;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fully funded scholarship for one-year postgraduate study.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Also covers tuition, accommodation, living stipends, field trips, and travel expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Available Programmes for NNPC Agip Postgraduate Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Only candidates with an offer of admission in disciplines related to the following areas should apply;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Geosciences\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engineering (Petroleum, Mechanical, Civil, Subsea, Electrical\u002FElectronics, Marine, Chemical)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Petroleum Economics\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Law (Oil and Gas\u002FPetroleum)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>NNPC Agip Postgraduate Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the postgraduate NNPC Agip Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess a minimum of a Second Class Upper Bachelor’s degree from a recognized Nigerian university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have secured admission into a Nigerian or Overseas university (based on the category being applied for) for a one-year Master’s Degree programme in any of the disciplines listed below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Not above 28 years of age by December 31st, 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have completed the one-year National Youth Service Corps (NYSC) programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess an international passport valid for travel at least one year from September 2026 (applicable to overseas category).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents for NNPC Agip Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 NNPC Agip Scholarship, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Passport photograph (450 × 450 pixels) with white background, not more than 6 months old. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Provisional admission letter for post-graduate studies 2025\u002F2026 session into any reputable university – Local\u002FOverseas. This admission letter must be for the course stated on the candidate’s application. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>First Degree Certificate \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>NYSC Discharge Certificate \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Valid ID card (Driver’s license, Voter’s card, National Identity card)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Valid International Passport Data Page for Overseas category only (Valid for travel at least one year from September 2026) \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Birth Certificate from Local government\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Feur10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\u002F?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsaas.scholastica.ng%2Ffiles%2Fnae-post-grad-scholarship-compliance-declaration.doc&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cchibueze%40dragnet-solutions.com%7C8be4de2fad824285abbe08de95c2ed78%7Cdf3fe24c69104d06b0e30a4af29be80f%7C0%7C0%7C639112861600049989%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=FTBjFxGmzcaB9OfhQ0N03YN1N6vO3K%2Fnt0EY8oJqizo%3D&amp;reserved=0\">NAE Compliance Declaration Form\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for NNPC Agip Postgraduate Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the NNPC\u002FAgip Postgraduate Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Download the \u003Ca class=\"wpel-icon-right\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Feur10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com\u002F?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsaas.scholastica.ng%2Ffiles%2Fnae-post-grad-scholarship-compliance-declaration.doc&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cchibueze%40dragnet-solutions.com%7C8be4de2fad824285abbe08de95c2ed78%7Cdf3fe24c69104d06b0e30a4af29be80f%7C0%7C0%7C639112861600049989%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=FTBjFxGmzcaB9OfhQ0N03YN1N6vO3K%2Fnt0EY8oJqizo%3D&amp;reserved=0\">\u003Cstrong>NAE compliance declaration form\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>On the application page, click on the “\u003Cstrong>Apply Now\u003C\u002Fstrong>” tab. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on “\u003Cstrong>Register Now\u003C\u002Fstrong>” to create and verify your account. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Login with your registered email and password to create your profile. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill in your details, and upload only applicable documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants for the Overseas category are encouraged to also apply for the Local Post Graduate Scholarship Award.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> Ensure the name used in the application matches the names on all documentation in the same order. Upload a sworn affidavit or certificate if otherwise. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> Ensure you view all documents after uploading, to eliminate errors during uploading. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recheck application information to avoid errors \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click “\u003Cstrong>Apply Now\u003C\u002Fstrong>” to submit information.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will receive an email that confirms your application was successful. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcandidate.scholastica.ng\u002Fschemes\u002Fthennpcltdnaescholarships2026\">https:\u002F\u002Fcandidate.scholastica.ng\u002Fschemes\u002Fthennpcltdnaescholarships2026\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-29 12:33:42",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fnnpc-agip-postgraduate-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69f1ec9623a613.02068035_screenshot 2026-04-29 122812.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fnnpc-agip-postgraduate-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69f1ec9623a613.02068035_screenshot%202026-04-29%20122812.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":48},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[44],{"fileName":45,"oldFileName":45,"type":18,"file":19,"url":46},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot%202026-06-24%20201924.png","2026-06-24 20:40:26","linkskool",{"id":50,"slug":51,"title":52,"ima